note Walks the font size down one pixel at a time from the current graph font until the tree's cell box, measured with that font's cell, fits the canvas less the margins, stopping at theme::smallest_fit_font. The zoom becomes exactly that size over the UI font (Zoom::of_fonts), so graph_font reproduces the same size next frame, and the pan puts the box's top-left at the margin. A Fitted action carries both and settles the wish; an empty graph settles it with no move.

